  "summary_en": "Brazilian national standard ABNT NBR 17225:2025 sets web accessibility requirements and recommendations based on WCAG 2.2, covering keyboard use, images, forms, colour contrast, media and timing. It defines regular (AA) and full (AAA) conformance and includes checklists. It is unrelated to AI or robotics.",
